        "text": "Borrow $$1$$ from the $$8$$.\\n$$8$$ becomes $$7$$.\\nAdd $$\\frac{6}{6}$$ to $$\\frac{1}{6}$$ to get $$\\frac{7}{6}$$.\\nThe mixed number becomes $$7$$ $$\\frac{7}{6}$$.",
